      "content": "thanks. could you add a section to the training about how to deal with the more 'chaotic' or irrational/unpredictable outbursts? sometimes patients just seem to act out in ways that feel almost -- I don't know -- mischievous or just completely lawless and difficult to reason with. how should staff approach those specific types of erratic behaviors?",
